From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: mtk_hnat: harden MIB snapshot locking and
 pending bind reclaim

Serialize per-PPE MIB snapshots and reclaim completed pending bind entries safely.
Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
---
